f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 169% of normal in May to June but only 66% in August to September. Grid 23601 had its driest year in 1965 at 71% of normal.</p>"}
